      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَامٌ</span></b>  <i>A place where cattle pasture by themselves where they please; a place where they rove
about, pasturing:</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مُسْتَامَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Freytag
